+                                            #   getPixel gate): beginFill,
+                                            #   beginGradientFill, endFill,
+                                            #   drawTriangles and a lineStyle
+                                            #   with NO fill open, all in one
+                                            #   comparison. The only canary
+                                            #   member that reads a script-drawn
+                                            #   Graphics off the CPU raster.
